        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Neajeeda ASEETA sea Abramu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'ata ng'asheesu ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Abramu aba giirgweatka, ak geehiimsa nea geeyeesha, “Adibeali Abramu, aniini geawooschi igeamboadaang'u; asi giimeardaang'u gaygwaheedu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Abramu, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, gaygoonean naaha aniini, nea aniini ea nukwa geanyi diy, nea siida jea gwahearan gheenyu ea Eliyeseriheeda mujiineeda Dameski?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi Abramu, “Ng'ula, ang'iing'i miigoonean jeata; nea soomjeanda sijiilsa jeedeaba gheenyu gayghoah siida jea gwahearanan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula, iimuchu ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA headaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Siisi mayghoah siida jea gwahearanyi; gaygwahearanyi orjeedang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooruuta jarooda ak gwayeesha, “Ang'weersiina humng'eeda, ak giyiidayi miinga, ea jea amuusa iita.” Ng'ata gwayeesha siidida, “Asi nih gichea gwadeena jeataang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwas iita NG'UTAMIIDA; ak aba headaanyi ghwanung' ghoah doobiiwnata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Abramu, “Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi eananeey ng'eanyiida Uru mida ng'eanyiida Galdayo, ak geagoonyeey ng'eanyiini ambala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Abramu, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ak gaydanaldaan gideaba gaydeambal?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha ASEETA niny, “Eanean haghweanda gweanyeeka asamwagu, ea mbooyda saawaat bea gweanyeew samwagu, ea lagweenda gweanyeeka asamwagu, ea ghariibajeanda ea bakpakcheanda mwanang'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweadu haleanjeeni seaniin, ak ghabwaashaada ghoah iyeenya, ak gageanu gabatiisiinyi; ak ea mabwaashaada dariidaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu rabearjeeka nal shageata ak goobitpisa diyeanga silajaada, hean ghahoan Abramu ghang'eatng'eata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwariikghta gamikta aseeta, goobissa Abramu ruweanga; ak ghang'ut muuwda ea sawanadeeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Abramu, “Nala aba huumwa gideaba jeataang'u gayghoah rabasta aba ng'eanyiida mii daanyaawa; ak gayghoah soomjooga aba ng'eanyiita, ak gajeesawan gweanyeew bughalaji ang'wan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaydeadu ghoorjooda badaydeaba eemeedida nung' ghoah soomjoogean, ama muchu gayghabeawa ng'eanyiita nea nibaruur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ang'iing'i, gaymeawa nea gibeahi hoyyoo; ak gajeebunyi nea gibeahi gwearguumeeda miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygabiigu hiji aba seaygeedeaba damanang'wan; aba gideaba munyasnacheeka fuga Amori miighwahit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gamikta aseeta ak gamisaniit, ng'ula, dahuuda joakghta aroosta beasta ea gheaboong'nyeanda sik dageascheeda banyeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba eaweedida gwasin NG'UTAMIIDA neajeeda sea Abramu nea gwayi, “Ng'eanyiini gaydaadaw jeacheangaagu, ghang'eada eenda Misri ea ghwahita eenda haw, was eenda Furati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ng'eanyiida fuga Ganaani, ea fuga Genisi, ea fuga Gadmoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea fuga Hiti, ea fuga Beresi, ea fuga Refaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea fuga Amori, ea fuga Ganaani, ea fuga Girgashi ea fuga Yebusi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
